    Fix: Add sequence number to janji temu ID to prevent duplicates
    
    Issue: Duplicate entry error when creating multiple janji temu on same day
    Root cause: ID format 04022026TCSJNJT has no unique sequence number
    
    Solution: Use IdGenerator with sequence number
    - OLD: 04022026TCSJNJT (same for all entries on same day)
    - NEW: 04022026001TCSJNJT, 04022026002TCSJNJT, etc.
    
    Format: DDMMYYYYNNNN + T + CS + JNJT
    - DDMMYYYY = Date (04022026)
    - NNNN = Sequence number (0001, 0002, ...)
    - T = Tabungan
    - CS = Cash
    - JNJT = Janji Temu
    
    Now supports multiple janji temu per day without conflicts

